     "**Material Volume (Injection):** A 3D texture storing per-voxel scattering radiance and extinction.",
     "**Integrated Volume:** A 3D texture storing accumulated radiance and transmittance.",
     "*   **Shadow map inside-solid lighting:** Shadow passes cull front faces, so shadow maps light solid interiors.",
     "Froxels inside occluders were incorrectly counted as shadowed.",
     "*   **Seam at max_distance:** A visible ring can appear at the boundary between volume and analytic fog.",
     "*   **Sub-pixel geometry:** Distant leaves or wires can depth-reject all bilateral taps, causing weights to underflow to 0 and collapse the pixel to black.",
     "*   **High anisotropy noise:** Causes banding near forward directions.",
     "*   **Camera cuts:** Temporal reprojection causes smearing across camera cuts.",
     "*   **Medium-transition:** Air/water lighting models must never blend.",
     "*   **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to the froxel grid dimensions."
    ]
